{"id":"wb-6-606","name":"袁州谯楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"袁州谯楼","text":"袁州谯楼位于中国江西省宜春市袁州区鼓楼路的中段，即现宜春鼓楼。1984年被列为宜春市文物保护单位，2000年以“袁州古天文台遗址”之名被列为江西省文物保护单位。2006年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A2%81%E5%B7%9E%E8%B0%AF%E6%A5%BC","revisionId":91886236,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91886236","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/bb9b0a3dfd31d26491fdd6e3.jpg","title":"Yichun_Yuanzhou_Qiaolou_2018.06.30_16-17-28.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yichun_Yuanzhou_Qiaolou_2018.06.30_16-17-28.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/Yichun_Yuanzhou_Qiaolou_2018.06.30_16-17-28.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"宜春袁州谯楼","width":320,"height":213}}